@startuml
title State Diagram — HU1: Business Registration (Administrator ↔ System messages)

' Refines the context-state TENANT_REGISTRATION (HU1).
' Actors: Business Administrator (Tenant) <-> System.

state "AWAITING_DATA\n(registration form)" as data
state "VALIDATING_SUBDOMAIN" as validating
state "TENANT_CREATED\n(isolated space enabled)" as created
state "REGISTRATION_REJECTED\n(subdomain conflict)" as rejected

[*] --> data : Admin→System: openRegistration

data --> validating : Admin→System: submitForm(name, email, subdomain)

validating --> created : System→Admin: registrationConfirmed\n[subdomain available] / createTenant(tenant_id), enableSubdomain
validating --> rejected : System→Admin: subdomainConflict\n[subdomain taken]

rejected --> data : Admin→System: correctSubdomain

created --> [*] : System→Admin: accessEnabled(my-business.jpasoftware.com)

note right of created
  Multitenant isolation:
  every Admin query is filtered
  by its tenant_id.
end note
@enduml
